    "**ADAM ID: **[sm\\_us6000t8le](https://api.adam.geospatial.wfp.org/api/collections/adam.adam_eq_events/items?uid=sm_us6000t8le) Magnitude 5.4 earthquake at 10.0 depth occurred on Jun 27 2026 53km NW of Rakhni. The epicentre of the earthquake was located at latitude 30.4545 longitude 69.6859. It impacted 111709 people within 50km. WFP’s Automated Disaster Analysis and Mapping (ADAM) system is an operational system for collecting, analysing and mapping geospatial and socio-economic information following sudden onset humanitarian emergencies."
